Changes made in drama3-lowmem
-----------------------------

Relative to commit 4dbb4d12:

- A ggml tensor type, GGML_TYPE_F8_E4M3_B128 (FP8 E4M3, 128 values plus one
  FP32 scale per block), with CPU (AVX-512) and CUDA kernels. Modified ggml
  files: include/ggml.h, src/ggml.c, src/ggml-common.h, src/ggml-impl.h,
  src/ggml-quants.c, src/ggml-quants.h, src/ggml-cpu/ggml-cpu.c,
  src/ggml-cpu/ops.cpp, src/ggml-cpu/quants.c, src/ggml-cpu/quants.h,
  src/ggml-cuda/common.cuh, src/ggml-cuda/convert.cu,
  src/ggml-cuda/dequantize.cuh, src/ggml-cuda/getrows.cu,
  src/ggml-cuda/ggml-cuda.cu, tests/test-backend-ops.cpp (all under
  external/ggml/). New: src/ggml-cuda/mmv-f8.cu, src/ggml-cuda/mmv-f8.cuh.
- Registration of that type as a tensor storage type:
  include/engine/framework/assets/tensor_source.h,
  src/framework/assets/tensor_source.cpp, src/framework/runtime/options.cpp.
- The fish_drama3 port: candidate-only LM head, host-side token embedding, a
  fused audio-tower step with on-device sampling, background codec decoding,
  CPU reference encoding, sentence and speaker-turn chunking, stall and
  early-end detection with retries, and teacher-forced dumps. Modified:
  include/engine/community_models/fish_drama3/{backbone,generator,tower}.h,
  src/community_models/fish_drama3/{backbone,generator,session,tower}.cpp,
  model_specs/fish_drama3.json, CMakeLists.txt. New:
  {include/engine,src}/community_models/fish_drama3/{sampler_graph,text_chunks}.
- The checkpoint converter keeps the official FP8 expert bytes unchanged:
  tools/community_models/convert_fish_drama3.py.
- New tests (tests/fp8, tests/drama3), validation tools
  (tools/community_models/drama3_*.py, tools/reference), scripts, Dockerfiles,
  benchmark cases and documentation (README.md, README.ja.md, docs/).
- The original audio.cpp README moved to UPSTREAM_README.md.

Modified source files carry a one-line "Modified for drama3-lowmem" comment.
The full history is in the git log.


