No code in this repository is copied from Fish Speech. The Drama 3 inference
code follows the model as implemented in SGLang-Omni
(https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang-omni, sglang_omni/models/fishaudio_drama3,
Apache License 2.0, Copyright 2025-2026 SGLang-Omni Team). tools/reference is an
