code and, for the Qwen3.5-MoE backbone, from SGLang
(https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang, python/sglang/srt/models/qwen3_5.py,
qwen2_moe.py, layernorm.py, fla/layernorm_gated.py; Apache License 2.0),
flash-linear-attention (https://github.com/fla-org/flash-linear-attention, MIT)
and Hugging Face Transformers (models/qwen3_5_moe, Apache License 2.0, used as a
cross-check). tools/reference/README.md lists the commits read.

